BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Mindful Petaluma
UID:event_315343030@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260708T031827Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T081500
SUMMARY:Simple Sitting Meditation
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream (CA)\nIn these sessions\, I will be doing g
 uided meditations where we simply sit and notice what arises.\n\nThere is 
 no agenda and no plan for how these sessions unfold. I might start off sim
 ply by asking us to notice what is already present. By becoming aware of w
 hat’s going on in our heads and in our body.\n\nThen\, the meditation ma
 y take on a life of its own.\n\nOur job is to simply be present to what ar
 ises. We may notice the mind moving and chattering about. Or we may notice
  that it’s completely silent.\n\nThe goal here\, if there is one\, is to
  simply let ourselves be as we are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstreamca/events/315343030/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260620T152024Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260620T152024Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Mindful Petaluma
UID:event_315354766@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260708T031827Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T074500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T080500
SUMMARY:Inner Body Guided-Meditation 
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream (CA)\n"Awareness of the inner body takes yo
 u beyond the mind." - Eckhart Tolle\n\nIn this mediation session we will b
 ring our attention here: to the inner body where we practise presence by f
 ocusing on our physical sensations.\n\nSessions are suitable for newcomers
 \, those experienced in Tolle's teachings and anyone wishing to remain com
 pletely anonymous. They will last around 20 minutes and cameras and microp
 hones will be disabled. (Depending on the situation\, a free discussion ma
 y be held at the end with mics and cameras allowed.)\n\nSessions are suita
 ble for newcomers\, those experienced in Tolle's teachings and anyone wish
 ing to remain completely anonymous. They will last around 20 minutes and c
 ameras and microphones will be disabled. (Depending on the situation\, a f
 ree discussion may be held at the end with mics and cameras allowed.)\n\nS
 ee you there!\n\nEmrys also organises a free Work of Byron Katie online me
 diation group. Visit [this Meetup Group link](https://www.meetup.com/thewo
 rk-runsfree/) for more information.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstreamca/events/315354766/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T145708Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T145708Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
